abstract: 'Hesperus Ivy is an Equinox-first fork of Ivy for portable, documented machine-learning primitives and source-to-source conversion between PyTorch, TensorFlow, JAX/Equinox, and NumPy. It retains upstream Ivy attribution while replacing the private binary compiler with a checked-in Python implementation.'
